","premodern":"not_legal","standard":"not_legal","standardbrawl":"not_legal","timeless":"not_legal","tlr":"not_legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"{3}{U}","name":"Mindlock Orb","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","oracle_text":"Players can't search libraries.","power":null,"produced_mana":[],"released_at":"2008-10-03","toughness":null,"type_line":"Artifact"},{"cmc":0.0,"color_identity":["W"],"colors":[],"defense":null,"keywords":[],"layout":"normal","legalities":{"alchemy":"legal","brawl":"legal","commander":"legal","competitivebrawl":"legal","duel":"legal","future":"legal","gladiator":"legal","historic":"legal","legacy":"legal","modern":"legal","oathbreaker":"legal","oldschool":"not_legal","pauper":"legal","paupercommander":"legal","penny":"legal","pioneer":"legal","predh":"legal","premodern":"legal","standard":"legal","standardbrawl":"legal","timeless":"legal","tlr":"legal","vintage":"legal"},"loyalty":null,"mana_cost":"","name":"Plains","oracle_id":"bc71ebf6-2056-41f7-be35-b2e5c34afa99","oracle_text":"({T}: Add {W}.)","power":null,"produced_mana":["W"],"released_at":"2026-11-13","toughness":null,"type_line":"Basic Land — Plains"}],"fixture_kind":"public_exact-list_card_data","rulings":[{"comment":"Effects that instruct you to reveal or look at cards from the top of you library will still work. Only effects that use the word \"search\" are affected.","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an effect says \"Search your library . . . then shuffle your library,\" you shuffle you libraries even though you can't search.","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an effect says \"You may search your library . . . If you do, shuffle your library\" or \"You may search your library . . . then shuffle your library,\" you can't choose to search, so you won't shuffle.","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The only difference between a colored artifact and a colorless artifact is, obviously, its color. Unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact requires colored mana to cast. Also unlike most artifacts, a colored artifact has a color in all zones. It will interact with cards that care about color. Other than that, a colored artifact behaves just like any other artifact. It will interact as normal with any card that cares about artifacts, such as Shatter or Arcbound Ravager.","oracle_id":"5794b58e-f3b6-4637-b288-283b3a72a718","published_at":"2008-10-01","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"After the search is complete, the entire library is shuffled.","oracle_id":"d9517c5d-66d0-4178-96fb-a8c04f311ad8","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"Each search works exactly the same as normal except that the opponent doing the searching sees only the top four cards of that library. They can't look at the other cards in that library at all. Cards not in the top four cards of the library can't be found in the search, even if they're identifiable in some manner.","oracle_id":"d9517c5d-66d0-4178-96fb-a8c04f311ad8","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"For effects that check whether a player searched a library or may search a library, searching the top four cards of that library counts as searching that library.","oracle_id":"d9517c5d-66d0-4178-96fb-a8c04f311ad8","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"If an effect uses the word \"search\" once but allows an opponent to search for multiple cards, the top four cards remain the same throughout the entire search. Finding one card won't cause the fifth card to become included in the search.","oracle_id":"d9517c5d-66d0-4178-96fb-a8c04f311ad8","published_at":"2021-03-19","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
